      "cited_text": "WFtotal ¼ WFgreen þWFblue þWFgrey ð11Þ The green and blue WFs were estimated as shown in Eqs. (12) and (13), respectively: WFgreen ¼ CWUgreen Y ¼ 10\u0002Plgp d¼1 ETgreen Y ð12Þ WFblue ¼ CWUblue Y ¼ 10\u0002Plgp d¼1 ETblue Y ð13Þ whereCWU is cropwater use (m3ha−1),Y is cropyield (tonha−1 year−1), ETgreen is green water evapotranspiration (mm day−1), and ETblue is blue water evapotranspiration (mm day−1). The CWU is calculated by the accumulation of daily evapotranspi-ration (ET, mm day−1) over the complete growing period (lgp). Evapotranspiration was calculated using the CROPWAT 8.0 model. The model uses the FAO Penman–Monteith method to calculate the reference evapotranspiration (Allen et al., 1998), as shown in Eq. (14):"
